# {{project_title}}

> Generated with `aistrap` using the `rag` template.

A lightweight retrieval-augmented generation starter. Ingestion, retrieval and
prompt building are implemented with the Python standard library only, so the
project runs the moment it is generated - no API keys, no vector database, no
model downloads. Every piece is small enough to read and replace.

## Project structure

```
{{project_name}}/
├── app/
│   ├── config.py      # Settings loaded from the environment
│   ├── ingestion.py   # Load documents and split them into chunks
│   ├── retrieval.py   # TF-IDF index and cosine similarity search
│   └── main.py        # CLI: ask a question, get an answer plus sources
├── config/            # Configuration files
├── data/              # Datasets (git-ignored by default)
├── documents/         # The corpus that gets indexed
